{"task_id": "d209ea052284914a", "model_key": "xiaomi-mimo-v2-6-flash", "raw_response": "## Computing the determinant\n\nExpanding along the first row (which has two zeros — cheapest path):\n\n$$\\det(A) = a_{11}C_{11} + a_{12}C_{12} + a_{13}C_{13}$$\n\n- $a_{11} = 0$ → term contributes 0.\n- $a_{12} = 0$ → term contributes 0.\n- $a_{13} = -2$, cofactor $C_{13} = +\\det\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 3\\\\ 1 & -3\\end{bmatrix} = (-3)(-3) - (3)(1) = 9 - 3 = 6$.\n\nSo\n\n$$\\det(A) = 0 + 0 + (-2)(6) = -12.$$\n\n**Check by expansion along the first column:**\n\n- $a_{11}=0$ → 0\n- $a_{21}=-3$, cofactor $= -\\det\\begin{bmatrix}0 & -2\\\\ -3 & -2\\end{bmatrix} = -\\big(0\\cdot(-2) - (-2)(-3)\\big) = -(-6) = 6$ → contribution $(-3)(6) = -18$\n- $a_{31}=1$, cofactor $= +\\det\\begin{bmatrix}0 & -2\\\\ 3 & -1\\end{bmatrix} = 0 - (-2)(3) = 6$ → contribution $6$\n\nTotal: $-18 + 6 = -12$. ✓\n\n{\"answer\": \"-12\"}", "parsed_answer": "-12", "correct": true, "parse_status": "correct", "error": null, "latency_ms": 13213, "usage": {"input": 244, "output": 688, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 315, "totalTokens": 932, "cost": {"input": 3.4160000000000005e-05, "output": 0.00019264000000000003, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0.00022680000000000004}}, "cost_usd": 0.00022680000000000004, "attempts": 1, "model_info": {"provider": "opencode-go", "model": "mimo-v2.6-flash", "api": "openai-completions", "thinkingLevel": "off", "responseId": "9286f5ae-3a40-497a-9d58-834b40e167dd_8f948eb9d8484ba4addf8a574c1f59ec"}, "stop_reason": "stop", "started_at": "2026-10-17T16:13:22+00:00", "finished_at": "2026-10-17T16:13:36+00:00"}
{"task_id": "847e4328701bb348", "model_key": "xiaomi-mimo-v2-6-flash", "raw_response": "## Setting up\n\nRecurrence: $a_n = -5a_{n-1} + 2a_{n-2}$, with $a_0 = 3$, $a_1 = -6$.\n\nI'll compute the exact integers first, then reduce mod 1009.\n\n**Exact terms:**\n- $a_2 = -5(-6) + 2(3) = 30 + 6 = 36$\n- $a_3 = -5(36) + 2(-6) = -180 - 12 = -192$\n- $a_4 = -5(-192) + 2(36) = 960 + 72 = 1032$\n- $a_5 = -5(1032) + 2(-192) = -5160 - 384 = -5544$\n- $a_6 = -5(-5544) + 2(1032) = 27720 + 2064 = 29784$\n- $a_7 = -5(29784) + 2(-5544) = -148920 - 11088 = -160008$\n- $a_8 = -5(-160008) + 2(29784) = 800040 + 59568 = 859608$\n- $a_9 = -5(859608) + 2(-160008) = -4298040 - 320016 = -4618056$\n- $a_{10} = -5(-4618056) + 2(859608) = 23090280 + 1719216 = 24809496$\n- $a_{11} = -5(24809496) + 2(-4618056) = -124047480 - 9236112 = -133283592$\n- $a_{12} = -5(-133283592) + 2(24809496) = 666417960 + 49618992 = 716036952$\n\n**Reduction:** $1009 \\times 709650 = 716036850$, and $716036952 - 716036850 = 102$. So $a_{12} \\equiv 102 \\pmod{1009}$.\n\n## Verification (working mod 1009 throughout)\n\n- $a_0 = 3$, $a_1 = 1003$\n- $a_2 = -5015 + 6 = -5009 \\equiv 36$\n- $a_3 = -180 + 2006 = 1826 \\equiv 817$\n- $a_4 = -4085 + 72 = -4013 \\equiv 23$\n- $a_5 = -115 + 1634 = 1519 \\equiv 510$\n- $a_6 = -2550 + 46 = -2504 \\equiv 523$\n- $a_7 = -2615 + 1020 = -1595 \\equiv 423$\n- $a_8 = -2115 + 1046 = -1069 \\equiv 949$\n- $a_9 = -4745 + 846 = -3899 \\equiv 137$\n- $a_{10} = -685 + 1898 = 1213 \\equiv 204$\n- $a_{11} = -1020 + 274 = -746 \\equiv 263$\n- $a_{12} = -1315 + 408 = -907 \\equiv 102$\n\nBoth routes agree.\n\n{\"answer\": \"102\"}", "parsed_answer": "102", "correct": true, "parse_status": "correct", "error": null, "latency_ms": 27512, "usage": {"input": 266, "output": 3071, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 2031, "totalTokens": 3337, "cost": {"input": 3.724e-05, "output": 0.00085988, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0.0008971200000000001}}, "cost_usd": 0.000897120000000000