{"task_id": "4e5f1e1db5f5033e", "model_key": "xiaomi-mimo-v2-6-flash", "raw_response": "## Setting up\n\n$$f(x) = (5x+5)(-x+5)(3x)(-4x+2)$$\n\nWrite $f = uvwz$ with\n- $u = 5x+5,\\; u' = 5$\n- $v = -x+5,\\; v' = -1$\n- $w = 3x,\\; w' = 3$\n- $z = -4x+2,\\; z' = -4$\n\nThen $f' = u'vwz + uv'wz + uvw'z + uvwz'$.\n\n## Evaluating factors at $x=-4$\n\n- $u = -20+5 = -15$\n- $v = 4+5 = 9$\n- $w = -12$\n- $z = 16+2 = 18$\n\n## Computing each term\n\n1. $u'vwz = 5\\cdot 9 \\cdot (-12)\\cdot 18 = 45 \\cdot (-216) = -9720$\n2. $uv'wz = (-15)(-1)(-12)(18) = 15\\cdot(-216) = -3240$\n3. $uvw'z = (-15)(9)(3)(18) = -135\\cdot 54 = -7290$\n4. $uvwz' = (-15)(9)(-12)(-4) = -135\\cdot 48 = -6480$\n\n## Summing\n\n$$-9720 - 3240 - 7290 - 6480 = -26730$$\n\n**Verification by expansion:** $f = (-5x^2+20x+25)(-12x^2+6x)$, so\n\n$$f'(x) = (-10x+20)(-12x^2+6x) + (-5x^2+20x+25)(-24x+6)$$\n\nAt $x=-4$: $(60)(-216) + (-135)(102) = -12960 - 13770 = -26730$. ✓\n\n{\"answer\": \"-26730\"}", "parsed_answer": "-26730", "correct": true, "parse_status": "correct", "error": null, "latency_ms": 34447, "usage": {"input": 268, "output": 1235, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 708, "totalTokens": 1503, "cost": {"input": 3.752e-05, "output": 0.0003458, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0.00038332}}, "cost_usd": 0.00038332, "attempts": 1, "model_info": {"provider": "opencode-go", "model": "mimo-v2.6-flash", "api": "openai-completions", "thinkingLevel": "off", "responseId": "d329f725-4d7f-4354-84c5-8a460f1db6bd_3349c7a8de5a476ab6e2e0cc0e7885d4"}, "stop_reason": "stop", "started_at": "2026-10-17T16:13:22+00:00", "finished_at": "2026-10-17T16:13:57+00:00"}
{"task_id": "4fac20d29191e3a2", "model_key": "xiaomi-mimo-v2-6-flash", "raw_response": "## Setting up\n\nThe system is:\n\n-5·x1 − x2 + 5·x3 = −21\n x1 − 3·x2 + 4·x3 = 1\n 2·x1 + 3·x2 + 3·x3 = 11\n\n## Elimination\n\nFrom the first equation:\nx2 = −5x1 + 5x3 + 21\n\nSubstitute into the second equation:\nx1 − 3(−5x1 + 5x3 + 21) + 4x3 = 1\nx1 + 15x1 − 15x3 − 63 + 4x3 = 1\n16x1 − 11x3 = 64 …(A)\n\nSubstitute into the third equation:\n2x1 + 3(−5x1 + 5x3 + 21) + 3x3 = 11\n2x1 − 15x1 + 15x3 + 63 + 3x3 = 11\n−13x1 + 18x3 = −52, i.e. 13x1 − 18x3 = 52 …(B)\n\nMultiply (A) by 13 and (B) by 16:\n208x1 − 143x3 = 832\n208x1 − 288x3 = 832\n\nSubtracting: 145x3 = 0 ⟹ x3 = 0.\n\nThen 16x1 = 64 ⟹ x1 = 4, and x2 = −5(4) + 5(0) + 21 = 1.\n\n## Verification\n\nCoefficient determinant:\ndet = −5[(−3)(3) − (4)(3)] − (−1)[(1)(3) − (4)(2)] + 5[(1)(3) − (−3)(2)]\n= −5(−9 − 12) + (3 − 8) + 5(3 + 6) = 105 − 5 + 45 = 145 ≠ 0,\n\nso the solution is unique (consistent with the problem statement).\n\nCheck:\n−5(4) − 1 + 5(0) = −20 − 1 = −21 ✓\n4 − 3(1) + 4(0) = 1 ✓\n2(4) + 3(1) + 3(0) = 8 + 3 = 11 ✓\n\n{\"answer\": [4, 1, 0]}", "parsed_answer": "[4, 1, 0]", "correct": true, "parse_status": "correct", "error": null, "latency_ms": 43356, "usage": {"input": 300, "output": 1186, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 590, "totalTokens": 1486, "cost": {"input": 4.2000000000000004e-05, "output": 0.00033208, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0.00037408}}, "cost_usd": 0.00037408, "attempts": 1, "model_info": {"provider": "opencode-go", "model": "mimo-v2.6-flash", "api": "openai-completions", "thinkingLevel": "off", "responseId": "785a03fd-7dcb-49c7-bbc5-71a21be45108_eb2722a6a7d64e2f92bca7c4607eed8c"}, "stop_reason": "stop", "started_at": "2026-10-17T16:13:22+00:00", "finished_at": "2026-10-17T16:14:06+00:00"}
{"task_id": "7e1d5aed4b26834e", "model_key": "xiaomi-mimo-v2-6-flash", "raw_response": "## Setting up the elimination\n\n**Augmented matrix:**\n\n```\n[  8   1   4  -6 | -11 ]\n[  0  -2   5  -1 |   7 ]\n[  8   6   7   0 |  11 ]\n[ -1  -5  -2  -6 | -14 ]\n```\n\n**Step 1:** Swap R1 with −R4 so the pivot is 1:\n\n```\nR1: [ 1   5   2   6 | 14]\nR2: [ 0  -2   5  -1 |  7]\nR3: [ 8   6   7   0 | 11]\nR4: [ 8   1   4  -6 |-11]\n```\n\n**Step 2:** R3 → R3 − 8R1, R4 → R4 − 8R1:\n\n```\nR3: [ 0  -34  -9  -48 | -101]\nR4: [ 0  -39  -12 -54 | -123]\n```\n\n**Step 3:** Eliminate the second column using pivot R2 = [0, −2, 5, −1 | 7]:\n\n- R3 → R3 − 17·R2 = [0, 0, −94, −31 | −220]\n- R4 → R4 + (13/2)·R2 = [0, 0, 73/2, 23/2 | 173/2], i.e. [0, 0, 73, 23 | 173]\n\n**Step 4:** Solve the 2×2 tail:\n\n```\n94·x3 + 31·x4 = 220\n73·x3 + 23·x4 = 173\n```\n\n73·(first) − 94·(second): (73·31 − 94·23)x4 = 73·220 − 94·173 → (2263 − 2162)x4 = 16060 − 16262 → 101·x4 = −202 → **x4 = −2**.\n\nThen 94·x3 + 31·(−2) = 220 → 94·x3 = 282 → **x3 = 3**.\n\n**Step 5:** Back-substitute:\n\n- From R2: −2x2 + 5(3) − (−2) = 7 → −2x2 + 17 = 7 → **x2 = 5**\n- From R1: x1 + 5(5) + 2(3) + 6(−2) = 14 → x1 + 19 = 14 → **x1 = −5**\n\n## Verification\n\n1. 8(−5) + 5 + 4(3) − 6(−2) = −40 + 5 + 12 + 12 = −11 ✓\n2. −2(5) + 5(3) − (−2) = −10 + 15 + 2 = 7 ✓\n3. 8(−5) + 6(5) + 7(3) = −40 + 30 + 21 = 11 ✓\n4. −(−5) − 5(5) − 2(3) − 6(−2) = 5 − 25 − 6 + 12 = −14 ✓\n\n{\"answer\": [-5, 5, 3, -2]}", "parsed_answer": "[-5, 5, 3, -2]", "correct": true, "parse_status": "correct", "error": null, "latency_ms": 43406, "usage": {"input": 198, "output": 2394, "cacheRead": 128, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 1526, "totalTokens": 2720, "cost": {"input": 2.7720000000000002e-05, "output": 0.0006703200000000001, "cacheRead": 3.584e-07, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0.0006983984000000001}}, "cost_usd": 0.0006983984000000001, "attempts": 1, "model_info": {"provider": "opencode-go", "model": "mimo-v2.6-flash", "api": "openai-completions", "thinkin