{"task_id": "ff727ac29c46eac0", "model_key": "xiaomi-mimo-v2-6-flash", "raw_response": "## Setting Up\n\nFor a product of 12 linear factors $P(x)=\\prod_{i=1}^{12}(a_i x+b_i)$, the coefficient of $x^{11}$ is obtained by choosing $x$ from exactly 11 factors and the constant from one:\n\n$$[x^{11}]P = \\sum_{i=1}^{12} a_i \\prod_{j\\neq i} b_j = \\Big(\\prod_j b_j\\Big)\\sum_{i=1}^{12}\\frac{a_i}{b_i}$$\n\n**Factors $(a_i,b_i)$:**\n$(-13,-10),\\ (4,8),\\ (-7,12),\\ (11,9),\\ (-11,12),\\ (-7,-9),\\ (10,6),\\ (9,-10),\\ (8,-8),\\ (-1,-14),\\ (13,-1),\\ (3,-13)$\n\n## Product of constant terms\n\nMagnitudes: $10\\cdot8\\cdot12\\cdot9\\cdot12\\cdot9\\cdot6\\cdot10\\cdot8\\cdot14\\cdot1\\cdot13$\n\n$10\\cdot8=80\\to960\\to8640\\to103{,}680\\to933{,}120\\to5{,}598{,}720\\to55{,}987{,}200\\to447{,}897{,}600\\to6{,}270{,}566{,}400\\to81{,}517{,}363{,}200$\n\nThere are 7 negative $b_i$, so $B=-81{,}517{,}363{,}200$.\n\n## Sum of $a_i/b_i$\n\n$$\\frac{13}{10}+\\frac12-\\frac7{12}+\\frac{11}{9}-\\frac{11}{12}+\\frac79+\\frac53-\\frac9{10}-1+\\frac1{14}-13-\\frac3{13}$$\n\nWith LCD $16{,}380$: numerators $21{,}294+8{,}190-9{,}555+20{,}020-15{,}015+12{,}740+27{,}300-14{,}742-16{,}380+1{,}170-212{,}940-3{,}780=-181{,}698$\n\n$$\\sum \\frac{a_i}{b_i}=\\frac{-181{,}698}{16{,}380}=\\frac{-30{,}283}{2{,}730}$$\n\n## Combine\n\n$$[x^{11}]P=\\frac{-81{,}517{,}363{,}200\\cdot(-30{,}283)}{2{,}730}=29{,}859{,}840\\cdot 30{,}283$$\n\n$$29{,}859{,}840\\cdot30{,}000=895{,}795{,}200{,}000,\\qquad 29{,}859{,}840\\cdot283=8{,}450{,}334{,}720$$\n\n$$[x^{11}]P = 904{,}245{,}534{,}720$$\n\n**Verification (direct sum of $a_i\\cdot B/b_i$):** \n$-105{,}972{,}572{,}160 -40{,}758{,}681{,}600 +47{,}551{,}795{,}200 -99{,}632{,}332{,}800 +74{,}724{,}249{,}600 -63{,}402{,}393{,}600 -135{,}862{,}272{,}000 +73{,}365{,}626{,}880 +81{,}517{,}363{,}200 -5{,}822{,}668{,}800 +1{,}059{,}725{,}721{,}600 +18{,}811{,}699{,}200 = 904{,}245{,}534{,}720$ ✓\n\n{\"answer\": \"904245534720\"}", "parsed_answer": "90424553472