{"task_id": "bf11352b940ce579", "model_key": "xiaomi-mimo-v2-6-flash", "raw_response": "## Setting up\n\nEach factor is of the form $a_i x + b_i$:\n\n| factor | $a_i$ | $b_i$ | $r_i = b_i/a_i$ |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| $3x-3$ | 3 | −3 | −1 |\n| $7x-2$ | 7 | −2 | −2/7 |\n| $-8x-2$ | −8 | −2 | 1/4 |\n| $5x-7$ | 5 | −7 | −7/5 |\n| $-5x-2$ | −5 | −2 | 2/5 |\n| $-8x-6$ | −8 | −6 | 3/4 |\n| $-4x+3$ | −4 | 3 | −3/4 |\n| $9x-7$ | 9 | −7 | −7/9 |\n\nThen $P(x) = A\\prod_{i=1}^{8}(x+r_i)$ with $A=\\prod a_i$, and\n$$[x^2]P = A\\cdot e_2(r_1,\\dots,r_8).$$\n\n**Leading coefficient:**\n$A = 3\\cdot7\\cdot(-8)\\cdot5\\cdot(-5)\\cdot(-8)\\cdot(-4)\\cdot9 = 1{,}209{,}600.$\n\n## First and second elementary symmetric sums of the roots' negatives\n\n$$e_1 = -1-\\tfrac27+\\tfrac14-\\tfrac75+\\tfrac25+\\tfrac34-\\tfrac34-\\tfrac79 = -2+\\tfrac14-\\tfrac27-\\tfrac79 = \\frac{-504+63-72-196}{252} = -\\frac{709}{252}.$$\n\n$$\\sum r_i^2 = 1+\\tfrac4{49}+\\tfrac1{16}+\\tfrac{49}{25}+\\tfrac4{25}+\\tfrac9{16}+\\tfrac9{16}+\\tfrac{49}{81} = \\frac{7{,}928{,}587}{1{,}587{,}600}.$$\n\nSince $e_1^2 = \\dfrac{502{,}681}{63{,}504} = \\dfrac{12{,}567{,}025}{1{,}587{,}600}$,\n\n$$e_2 = \\frac{e_1^2 - \\sum r_i^2}{2} = \\frac{12{,}567{,}025-7{,}928{,}587}{3{,}175{,}200} = \\frac{4{,}638{,}438}{3{,}175{,}200} = \\frac{85{,}897}{58{,}800} = \\frac{49\\cdot 1753}{49\\cdot 1200} = \\frac{1753}{1200}.$$\n\n**Cross‑check by grouping** ($G_1=\\{-1,-\\tfrac79\\},\\ G_2=\\{-\\tfrac75,\\tfrac25\\},\\ G_3=\\{\\tfrac14,\\tfrac34,-\\tfrac34\\},\\ G_4=\\{-\\tfrac27\\}$):\n\n- within: $\\tfrac79-\\tfrac{14}{25}-\\tfrac9{16} = -\\tfrac{1241}{3600}$\n- cross: $\\tfrac{16}{9}-\\tfrac49+\\tfrac{32}{63}-\\tfrac14+\\tfrac27-\\tfrac1{14} = \\tfrac{65}{36}$\n\n$$e_2 = \\tfrac{6500}{3600}-\\tfrac{1241}{3600} = \\tfrac{5259}{3600} = \\tfrac{1753}{1200}. \\checkmark$$\n\n## Final computation\n\n$$[x^2]P = 1{,}209{,}600 \\cdot \\frac{1753}{1200} = 1008 \\cdot 1753 = 1{,}767{,}024.$$\n\n{\"answer\": \"1767024\"}", "parsed_answe