{"task_id": "a893e93baec2bc2b", "model_key": "xiaomi-mimo-v2-6-flash", "raw_response": "# Computing det(A)\n\n**Matrix:**\n$$A=\\begin{bmatrix}5&0&-7&7&1\\\\0&1&2&-4&6\\\\-3&4&2&-5&-2\\\\-2&-5&2&2&-4\\\\-6&-4&-5&-6&-7\\end{bmatrix}$$\n\nI'll use the **Bareiss fraction-free elimination**, where at step $k$:\n$$a^{(k)}_{ij}=\\frac{a^{(k-1)}_{kk}a^{(k-1)}_{ij}-a^{(k-1)}_{ik}a^{(k-1)}_{kj}}{a^{(k-1)}_{k-1,k-1}}$$\n\n**Step 1** (pivot $5$, divisor $1$): for $i,j\\ge 2$, $a_{ij}\\mapsto 5a_{ij}-a_{i1}a_{1j}$:\n\n$$\\begin{bmatrix}5&10&-20&30\\\\20&-11&-4&-7\\\\-25&-4&24&-18\\\\-20&-67&12&-29\\end{bmatrix}$$\n\n*(e.g. $5(-5)-(-3)(7)=-25+21=-4$)*\n\n**Step 2** (pivot $5$, divisor $5$): e.g. $a_{33}=\\frac{5(-11)-20(10)}{5}=\\frac{-255}{5}=-51$:\n\n$$\\begin{bmatrix}-51&76&-127\\\\46&-76&132\\\\-27&-68&91\\end{bmatrix}$$\n\n**Step 3** (pivot $-51$, divisor $5$): e.g. $a_{44}=\\frac{(-51)(-76)-46(76)}{5}=\\frac{380}{5}=76$, and $a_{45}=\\frac{-51(132)-46(-127)}{5}=\\frac{-890}{5}=-178$; similarly row 5 gives $(1104,\\,-1614)$:\n\n$$\\begin{bmatrix}76&-178\\\\1104&-1614\\end{bmatrix}$$\n\n**Step 4** (pivot $76$, divisor $-51$):\n\n$$\\det A=\\frac{76(-1614)-1104(-178)}{-51}=\\frac{-122664+196512}{-51}=\\frac{73848}{-51}=-1448$$\n\n**Verification by full upper-triangular elimination:** pivots are $5,\\;1,\\;-\\tfrac{51}{5},\\;-\\tfrac{76}{51},\\;-\\tfrac{6154}{323}$, giving\n$5\\cdot1\\cdot(-\\tfrac{51}{5})(-\\tfrac{76}{51})\\cdot(-\\tfrac{6154}{323}) = 76\\cdot(-\\tfrac{6154}{323}) = -\\tfrac{4\\cdot6154}{17} = -4\\cdot362 = -1448.$ ✓\n\nBoth methods agree.\n\n{\"answer\": \"-1448\"}", "parsed_answer": "-1448", "correct": true, "parse_status": "correct", "error": null, "latency_ms": 153921, "usage": {"input": 288, "output": 9489, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 8661, "totalTokens": 9777, "cost": {"input": 4.032e-05, "output": 0.00265692, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0.00269724}}, "cost_usd": 0.00269724, "attempts": 2, "model_info": {"provider": "opencode-go", "model": "mimo-v2.6-flash", "api": "openai-completions", "thinkingLevel": "off", "responseId": "3efe4224-fe92-41c8-8bc9-c4eebee626d7_92fbe6ef9f0b40edade6c03d2d983eb6"}, "stop_reason": "stop", "started_at": "2026-10-17T16:16:01+00:00", "finished_at": "2026-10-17T16:22:36+00:00"}
